| #1 | Lines 128-149 | ✓ YES | HIGH | No atomic read-modify-write; concurrent calls lose data |
| #2 | Lines 1944-1947, 2265 | ✓ YES | HIGH | Unprotected res.write(); no client disconnect handler in orchestration endpoint |
